WEBVTT

00:16:59.704 --> 00:17:02.121
And then I started to think
about things that

00:17:02.121 --> 00:17:05.954
I had to do to make sure that
both he and I were OK.

00:17:06.329 --> 00:17:09.871
It was around that time that he heard
about an internship at Morgan Stanley.

00:17:10.413 --> 00:17:13.246
I was one of five kids that
got to interview Adam.

00:17:13.246 --> 00:17:18.621
I showed up in a gold suit, black shirt,
black and gold tie, and I got the job

00:17:18.954 --> 00:17:20.329
that opened the door for him.

00:17:20.454 --> 00:17:23.246
And then as Mandela was nearing
the end of his internship,

00:17:23.538 --> 00:17:25.329
his colleagues opened another door.

00:17:25.663 --> 00:17:28.996
My colleagues knew my personal situation

00:17:29.329 --> 00:17:31.704
and they essentially put
it out there that, hey,